# Deploy envelope. Everything below is either authoring state or CI-only
# support; letting it into the Vercel upload has done real harm — a Vercel
# Marketplace scanner tripped on .agents/skills/prototype and every
# production deploy for five hours errored on it, silently keeping the
# site stale through eight commits.
.agents/
.claude/
MEMORY.md
memory/
db/
services/*/test/
packages/*/test/
apps/pwa/test/
docs/
.github/
scripts/check-secrets.mjs
